language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

port SerialObservationPort.
port PermissiveObservationPort.
port LabArtifactPort.
port ConsoleInteractionPort.
adapter PassiveSerialAdapter.
adapter ReplayInputAdapter.
adapter PermissiveInputAdapter.
adapter LabFileAdapter.
adapter ConsoleAdapter.

P1000Gateway contains PassiveSerialAdapter.
MachineService contains PermissiveInputAdapter.
LabKit contains ReplayInputAdapter.
LabKit contains LabFileAdapter.
LabKit contains ConsoleAdapter.
P1000Gateway exposes SerialObservationPort.
MachineService exposes PermissiveObservationPort.
LabKit exposes LabArtifactPort.
LabKit exposes ConsoleInteractionPort.
SerialObservationPort follows PhysicalSerialContract.
PermissiveObservationPort follows PermissiveContract.
SerialObservationPort through PassiveSerialAdapter.
PermissiveObservationPort through PermissiveInputAdapter.
LabArtifactPort through LabFileAdapter.
ConsoleInteractionPort through ConsoleAdapter.
PassiveSerialAdapter specifies "Design-only passive read boundary; no writable serial default. Partial bytes/framing and disconnects are explicit.".
ReplayInputAdapter specifies "Recorded inputs at explicit target layer, deterministic order and simulated time; default isolated target only.".
PermissiveInputAdapter specifies "Typed external presence/permissive input distinct from P1000 framing; unknown signal cannot silently grant authority.".
LabFileAdapter specifies "Bounded explicit-path artifact read/write with offset/integrity and failure outcomes; production persistence is a different owner.".
ConsoleAdapter specifies "stdin commands use the same public contracts; stdout application output and stderr diagnostics remain distinct from runtime diagnostics.".
